@startuml
title Application timeline of MiCA (Articles 143 and 149, Article 110a)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #EAF4F4
  BorderColor #2F6F73
}
start
:29 June 2023
Entry into force; empowerments for
delegated acts and technical standards;
:30 June 2024
Titles III and IV apply
(asset-referenced tokens, e-money tokens);<<#B7DBDB>>
:30 July 2024
Deadline for pre-existing ART issuers
to apply for authorisation (Art. 143(4));
:30 December 2024
All other titles apply
(white papers, CASPs, market abuse, supervision);<<#B7DBDB>>
:30 June 2025
Commission interim report (Art. 140);
:1 July 2026
Latest end of the CASP transitional
period (Art. 143(3));
:30 June 2027
Commission report with possible
legislative proposal (Art. 140);
:31 December 2027
White paper required for crypto-assets
admitted to trading before 30 Dec. 2024 (Art. 143(2));
:10 January 2030
Inside information also submitted
to ESAP (Art. 110a);
stop
@enduml
